    "The system validates the payload against the `CadAlert` model.",
    "The system checks that the call id has not been used before.",
    "The system creates `Incident` INC-nnnn (status open) and broadcasts an `incident` event.",
    "The system selects the nearest drone with status idle and battery of 30% or more.",
    "The system sets the drone to `en_route`, stores the drone id, distance and `dispatchSeconds` on the incident, and broadcasts the new dispatch status.",
    "The API returns `201` with the incident id, drone id, dispatch time and distance. The HAL mission starts (simulation mode): telemetry and thermal frames begin streaming.",
